msgid "Highlight channel"
msgstr "Kanal hervorheben"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1617
msgid ""
"The axes of this channel (from its axis mix in the selected profile) are "
"highlighted in the sketch and the live display"
msgstr ""
"Die Achsen dieses Kanals (aus seinem Achsen-Mix im gewählten Profil) werden "
"in Skizze und Live-Anzeige hervorgehoben"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1632
#, c-format
msgid "Scroll V: %s     Scroll H: %s     Zoom: %s"
msgstr "Scroll V: %s     Scroll H: %s     Zoom: %s"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1635
#, c-format
msgid ""
"<b>%s</b> uses: <b>%s</b>\n"
"<small>%s  (Profile: %s)</small>"
msgstr ""
"<b>%s</b> verwendet: <b>%s</b>\n"
"<small>%s  (Profil: %s)</small>"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1643
msgid ""
"Which direction of an axis counts as positive depends on the device - the "
"wizard below determines axes and signs automatically."
msgstr ""
"Welche Richtung einer Achse positiv zählt, hängt vom Gerät ab - der "
"Assistent unten ermittelt Achsen und Vorzeichen automatisch."

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1646
msgid "SpaceMouse axes"
msgstr "Achsen der SpaceMouse"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1656
msgid ""
"Raw values from spacenavd, range -350..350 (center = at rest). Own, read-"
"only connection - only active while this window is open."
msgstr ""
"Rohwerte von spacenavd, Bereich -350..350 (Mitte = Ruhe). Eigene, rein "
"lesende Verbindung - nur aktiv, solange dieses Fenster offen ist."

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1659
msgid "Live display"
msgstr "Live-Anzeige"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1665
msgid ""
"The wizard guides you through five short movements (3 s each) and derives "
"the axis mixes for vertical scroll, horizontal scroll and zoom, including "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"Der Assistent führt durch fünf kurze Bewegungen (je 3 s) und ermittelt "
"daraus die Achsen-Mixe für vertikales Scrollen, horizontales Scrollen und "
"Zoom samt Richtung."

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1674
#, c-format
msgid "The result applies to the profile selected above: %s"
msgstr "Das Ergebnis gilt für das oben gewählte Profil: %s"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1678
msgid "Learn axes…"
msgstr "Achsen einlernen…"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1691
msgid "New device profile"
msgstr "Neues Geräteprofil"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1691
msgid "New program profile"
msgstr "Neues Programmprofil"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1693
msgid "_Create"
msgstr "_Anlegen"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1700
msgid ""
"The profile applies when the device name of the SpaceMouse (as spacenavd "
"reports it, e.g. \"SpaceMouse Pro\" or \"SpaceMouse Compact\"; it is in the "
"journal when the daemon starts: journalctl --user -u dofscroll.service) "
"contains this text. Case-insensitive, a substring is enough."
msgstr ""
"Das Profil greift, wenn der Gerätename der SpaceMouse (wie spacenavd ihn "
"meldet, z. B. \"SpaceMouse Pro\" oder \"SpaceMouse Compact\"; steht beim "
"Start des Daemons im Journal: journalctl --user -u dofscroll.service) diesen "
"Text enthält. Groß-/Kleinschreibung egal, Teiltext genügt."

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1705
msgid ""
"The profile applies when the WM_CLASS of the active window contains this "
"text (\"instance class\" is compared in lowercase, e.g. \"navigator firefox"
"\"). Determine it with: xprop WM_CLASS and then click into the window. Case-"
"insensitive, a substring is enough. Program profiles apply after device "
"profiles (so they win). Programs can also be switched off here (e.g. Blender "
"with its own 3D navigation): create a profile and uncheck \"Control active "
"in this profile\" in it."
msgstr ""
"Das Profil greift, wenn die WM_CLASS des aktiven Fensters diesen Text "
"enthält (verglichen wird \"Instanz Klasse\" in Kleinschreibung, z. B. "
"\"navigator firefox\"). Ermitteln mit: xprop WM_CLASS und dann ins Fenster "
"klicken. Groß-/Kleinschreibung egal, Teiltext genügt. Programmprofile gelten "
"nach Geräteprofilen (gewinnen also). Hier lassen sich auch Programme "
"ausschalten (z. B. Blender mit eigener 3D-Navigation): Profil anlegen und "
"darin \"Steuerung in diesem Profil aktiv\" abwählen."

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1716
msgid "e.g. SpaceMouse Pro"
msgstr "z. B. SpaceMouse Pro"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1716
msgid "e.g. firefox"
msgstr "z. B. firefox"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1733
msgid "Pattern must not be empty or contain ']'"
msgstr "Das Muster darf nicht leer sein und kein ']' enthalten"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1752
msgid "Invalid pattern: it must not be empty or contain ']' or a line break."
msgstr ""
"Ungültiges Muster: Es darf nicht leer sein und kein ']' oder Zeilenumbruch "
"enthalten."

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1772
#, c-format
msgid "Delete profile \"%s\"?"
msgstr "Profil \"%s\" löschen?"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1836
msgid ""
"There are no program or device profiles yet. Create one with \"New program "
"profile...\" above; it then appears here."
msgstr ""
"Es gibt noch keine Programm- oder Geräteprofile. Lege oben mit \"Neues "
"Programmprofil...\" eines an; es erscheint dann hier."

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1848
#, c-format
msgid "%s (missing)"
msgstr "%s (fehlt)"

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1874
msgid ""
"A mode defines what the three channels and the buttons do. Modes are loaded "
"from the modes folder; the choice is saved as MODE in the profile."
msgstr ""
"Ein Modus legt fest, was die drei Kanäle und die Tasten tun. Modi werden aus "
"dem Modi-Ordner geladen; die Auswahl wird als MODE im Profil gespeichert."

#: src/dofscroll_tray.cpp:1885
msgid "Application modes"
msgstr "Anwendungsmodi"

